    "---\n",
    "## Quick Reference Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "| Concept | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Classification | Predicts discrete class labels (Binary or Multi-class) |\n",
    "| Logistic Regression | Linear regression + sigmoid -> probability 0-1 |\n",
    "| Sigmoid | sigma(z) = 1/(1+e^-z), z = beta_0 + beta_1*X1 + ... |\n",
    "| Decision threshold | Default 0.5, adjustable based on business need |\n",
    "| Log Loss | -(1/n)*sum[y*log(y_hat) + (1-y)*log(1-y_hat)] |\n",
    "| Accuracy | (TP+TN)/(TP+TN+FP+FN) -- unreliable for imbalanced data |\n",
    "| Precision | TP/(TP+FP) -- minimise false alarms |\n",
    "| Recall | TP/(TP+FN) -- minimise missed positives |\n",
    "| F1 Score | Harmonic mean of Precision and Recall |\n",
    "| ROC-AUC | Threshold-independent model quality (0.5=random, 1.0=perfect) |\n",
    "| OvR | N binary classifiers, highest probability wins |\n",
    "| Softmax | Single model, N outputs summing to 1.0 |\n",
    "\n",
